# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored — NEVER commit it) and fill in.
#
#   cp .env.example .env      # then paste your key after the =
#
# `OPENAI_API_KEY` is read from the environment exactly once, at composition
# time, in avid/core/config.py (P7 — configuration is injected, never read).
# The SPK-1 Realtime cost spike harness (spikes/spk1_realtime_cost/) also reads
# it from `.env` so real billing can be measured without exporting a global.
#
# Secrets never live in a committed file, a log line, or a repr (SECURITY.md).

OPENAI_API_KEY=
